+        // RefCell excludes other internal borrows. `main` is fixed and NUL
+        // terminated. The pinned VFS opcode writes at most eight aligned u64s
+        // to this initialized stack buffer, retaining no pointer. No raw
+        // handle or descriptor escapes. Unsupported VFSes return an error.
